// Crops (pbd_core::farming, `farming-and-smelting` decision 3, after M8's
// table in docs/mockups/farming.html). Per crop: `days` from sowing to ripe
// in game days (a game day is 2880 s of world time, which passes only while
// the world is played), `produce` and `seeds` given at harvest, in items.
//
// The code defaults written out; a test holds the two together.
(
    wheat:      (days: 6.0, produce: 3, seeds: 2),
    turnip:     (days: 4.0, produce: 2, seeds: 2),
    frost_kale: (days: 5.0, produce: 2, seeds: 2),
    chili:      (days: 5.0, produce: 4, seeds: 2),
    // Wild plants: one grassy cell in `wild_one_in` grows one, which gives
    // `wild_seeds` seeds and one produce when picked. Digging a grassy cell
    // turns up a seed in one cell in `grass_seed_one_in`. Cells.
    wild_one_in: 40,
    wild_seeds: 2,
    grass_seed_one_in: 4,
)
